 Durgā.\n — β〉 *einer Göttin im Dienste des 12ten Arhantʼs der Jaina in der gegenwärtigen Avasarpiṇī.\n — γ〉 *eines Flusses.\n — c〉 eine best. Pflanze. nach den Lexicographen Andropogon aciculatus, Mucuna pruriens^1 (RĀJAN. 3,38), Salvinia cucullata, weisses Dūrvā-Gras und = लिङ्गिनी RĀJAN. 3,34.\n— 4〉 f. चण्डी\n — a〉 Bein. der Durgā.\n — b〉 N. pr.\n — α〉 eines Wesens im Gefolge der Durgā.\n — β〉 der Gemahlin Uddālakaʼs.\n — c〉 abgekürzt so v. a. चण्डीमाहात्म्य.\n — d〉 ein best. Metrum.\n— 5〉 *n. Nom. abstr. zu 1〉a〉.\n[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk, Thomas Malten on 20241207. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/PWK/issues/111.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["चंड", "चण्डं", "चण्डः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["caMqa", "caRqaM", "caRqaH"]}, {"id": "cARqa", "headword": "चाण्ड", "headword_slp1": "cARqa", "fold": "caRqa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*चाण्ड\n— 1〉 m. Patron. von चण्ड.\n— 2〉 n. Nom. abstr. von चण्ड 1〉.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["चांडं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["cAMqaM"]}], "caRqakara": [{"id": "caRqakara", "headword": "चण्डकर", "headword_slp1": "caRqakara", "fold": "caRqakara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "चण्डकर m. die Sonne.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["चण्डकरः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["caRqakaraH"]}], "caRqakaray": [{"id": "caRqakarAy", "headword": "चण्डकराय्", "headword_slp1": "caRqakarAy", "fold": "caRqakaray", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "!√चण्डकराय्, ˚यते wie die Sonne erscheinen Spr. 2246.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "caRqakarman": [{"id": "caRqakarman", "headword": "चण्डकर्मन्", "headword_slp1": "caRqakarman", "fold": "caRqakarman", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "चण्डकर्मन् m. N